html='''<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>像素关卡工坊</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"></head><body>
<header><div class="brand"><span class="brandmark">▦</span><div><strong>像素关卡工坊</strong><small>PIXEL LEVEL STUDIO</small></div></div><input id="title" aria-label="关卡名称" maxlength="60" value="我的第一关"><span id="save-state" role="status">本地草稿</span><nav><button id="new">新建</button><button id="example">载入示例</button><button id="import">导入</button><button id="export" class="primary">导出关卡 ↗</button></nav></header>
<main><aside class="left panel"><div class="section-title"><h2>画布与工具</h2><span>01</span></div><div class="size-row"><label>宽<input id="width" type="number" min="4" max="160" value="20"></label><span>×</span><label>高<input id="height" type="number" min="4" max="160" value="20"></label><button id="resize">应用</button></div><div class="tools" role="group" aria-label="绘图工具"><button data-tool="brush" title="画笔 B">✎<span>画笔 B</span></button><button data-tool="erase" title="橡皮 E">◇<span>橡皮 E</span></button><button data-tool="fill" title="填充 F">▨<span>填充 F</span></button><button data-tool="rect" title="矩形 R">□<span>矩形 R</span></button><button data-tool="pick" title="取色 I">⌖<span>取色 I</span></button><button data-tool="select" title="框选 V">▧<span>框选 V</span></button></div><p class="hint" id="tool-hint">拖动画笔绘制；右键擦除。</p>
<div class="section-title palette-title"><h2>颜色材料</h2><span>34 色</span></div><div id="palette" class="palette" role="group" aria-label="画笔颜色"></div><div class="current-color"><span id="current-swatch"></span><div><strong id="color-name"></strong><small id="color-code"></small></div></div>
<div class="section-title"><h2>关卡设置</h2></div><div class="settings"><label>等待槽<input id="slots" type="number" min="1" max="20" value="5"></label><label>传送带容量<input id="belt" type="number" min="1" max="20" value="5"></label><label>难度标签<select id="difficulty"><option>Very Easy</option><option selected>Easy</option><option>Medium</option><option>Hard</option><option>Very Hard</option><option>Ultra Hard</option></select></label><label>物理宽<input id="physical-width" type="number" min="1" max="30" step=".1" value="5"></label><label>物理高<input id="physical-height" type="number" min="1" max="30" step=".1" value="5"></label></div><div class="note">当前支持普通像素与基础射手。配平检查不等于可解性证明。</div></aside>
<section class="workspace"><div class="canvas-toolbar"><div><button id="undo" title="撤销 Ctrl+Z">↶ 撤销</button><button id="redo" title="重做 Ctrl+Shift+Z">↷ 重做</button></div><div><button id="flip">左右翻转</button><button id="grid" aria-pressed="true">网格</button><button id="fit">适配</button><label class="zoom"><input id="zoom" type="range" min="6" max="36" value="22" aria-label="缩放"><span id="zoom-label">22 px</span></label></div></div><div id="canvas-wrap"><div class="board-label">图案编辑 <span id="dimensions"></span></div><canvas id="canvas" tabindex="0" aria-label="像素图案编辑区，使用鼠标绘图"></canvas><div id="empty-guide">选一个颜色，画下你的第一块像素</div></div><div class="canvas-status"><span id="cursor">坐标从左下角开始</span><span id="pixel-count"></span><button id="png">导出图案 PNG</button><button id="clear" class="text-danger">清空图案</button></div>
<section class="balance panel"><div class="balance-head"><div><h2>颜色供需</h2><p>比较像素目标与队列弹药，不判断通关解法。</p></div><span id="balance-status"></span></div><div id="balance-rows"></div></section></section>
<aside class="right panel"><div class="section-title"><h2>射手队列</h2><span>02</span></div><p class="hint">上方先出场。拖动射手可跨列排序；点击可编辑。</p><div class="queue-controls"><label>列数<select id="columns"><option>2</option><option>3</option><option selected>4</option><option>5</option></select></label><label>单体弹量<input id="default-ammo" type="number" min="1" max="9999" value="30"></label></div><button id="generate" class="generate">按图案生成配平队列</button><div id="queue-wrap"><div id="queues"></div></div><div class="shooter-editor" id="shooter-editor"><h3>射手属性</h3><p class="hint" id="shooter-placeholder">点击队列中的射手进行编辑。</p><div id="shooter-fields" hidden><div class="settings"><label>颜色<select id="shooter-color"></select></label><label>弹药<input id="shooter-ammo" type="number" min="1" max="9999"></label><label>所在列<select id="shooter-column"></select></label></div><div class="shooter-actions"><button id="move-up">↑ 前移</button><button id="move-down">↓ 后移</button><button id="duplicate">复制</button><button id="delete-shooter" class="text-danger">删除</button></div></div></div><div class="queue-footer"><span id="shooter-count"></span><small>选中颜色后，点各列「＋」添加射手。</small></div></aside></main>
<footer><span>草稿保存在当前浏览器 · 导出 JSON 可独立备份</span><span>B 画笔 · E 橡皮 · F 填充 · R 矩形 · I 取色 · V 框选 · Delete 删除选区</span></footer>
<input id="file" type="file" accept=".json,.txt" hidden><div id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
<dialog id="confirm-dialog"><h2 id="dialog-title"></h2><p id="dialog-message"></p><div><button id="cancel">取消</button><button id="confirm" class="primary">确认</button></div></dialog>
<script src="data.js"></script><script src="core.js"></script><script src="app.js"></script></body></html>'''
(out/"index.html").write_text(html,encoding="utf-8")
